---
// Floating home button (bottom-right corner)
---

<button onclick="window.location.href='../learning-resources.html'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#dc7600'; this.style.transform='scale(1)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 12px rgba(255, 153, 0, 0.3)';" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#E68900'; this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 6px 16px rgba(255, 153, 0, 0.4)';" style="position: fixed; bottom: 30px; right: 30px; background-color: #dc7600; color: white; border: none; padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 153, 0, 0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease; z-index: 1000;">
   🏠 リソース集に戻る
  </button>
